Generated documentation assets
==============================

Scribble and Racket
-------------------

Generated HTML documentation contains CSS and JavaScript supplied by Scribble
9.3. Scribble is offered under Apache-2.0 OR MIT; this distribution selects the
MIT option. The upstream notice and full selected terms are reproduced in
LICENSES/Racket-Scribble.txt.

Embedded fonts
--------------

Generated manual-fonts.css embeds Cooper Hewitt and Fira under SIL Open Font
License 1.1 and Bitstream Charter under Bitstream's permissive notice. Each
complete notice is embedded alongside the font data in manual-fonts.css; the
copyright and license summary is also in LICENSES/Embedded-Fonts.txt.

The source documentation and tests in this package are original Rhombus/HOL
material under 0BSD. HOL Light, HOL4, ACL2, and QuickCheck notices applicable
to the implementation are bundled with the rhombus-hol-kernel and
rhombus-hol-lib packages.
